/**
 * FormsPage — the forms the plan implies (docs/v4-spec.md §3.8).
 *  - control: TSR register, caution orders T/409 and T/409B, T/351 register
 *  - tms: TSRs on the corridor (propose, request relaxation), T/409 preview
 *  - smms: T/351 register (issue, mark reconnected)
 *  - tdms: power-block isolation record (de-energised / energised)
 * Orders and notices are generated by the engine from the working blocks and
 * the TSR register; statuses are recorded with store actions. Every printed
 * form goes through FormSheet (not-official watermark).
 */
